This product deploys and integrates with the following upstream projects,
which are separate works under their own licenses:

- OpenClaw (https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw) — MIT License.
  Deployed as the pinned upstream container image; not distributed in
  this repository.
- Hermes Agent (https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent) — MIT License.
  Fetched and installed from a checksum-verified source commit at deploy time;
  not distributed in this repository.
- gstack (https://github.com/garrytan/gstack) — MIT License.
  Fetched at deploy time as a pinned commit for the Hermes runtime; not
  distributed in this repository.
- Open WebUI (https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui) — distributed under
  its upstream license. Deployed as a digest-pinned container image for the
  Hermes browser surface; not distributed in this repository.
- OpenTofu (https://opentofu.org) — MPL-2.0. Downloaded by the CLI as a
  pinned, checksum-verified binary; not distributed in this repository.
